message: "If you use the embedded-AI catalogue or its tooling, please cite it."
title: "embedded-AI: an evidence-first catalogue of embeddable AI"
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable catalogue of on-device and embedded AI models, toolkits
  and non-AI primitives, with hardware, runtime and compatibility evidence,
  an offline plain-language need matcher, and explicit unknowns. Code is
  licensed MIT; the catalogue data is licensed CC BY 4.0.
